BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lefkada-pinakochori-lamparda-of-agios-ioannis-fire-jumping-pinakocho-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270623
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270625
SUMMARY:Lamparda of Agios Ioannis (fire-jumping)\, Pinakochori
LOCATION:Pinakochori\, Lefkada\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On the eve of St John's day the Sfakiotes village of Pinakochori lights big bonfires ('lamparda') of last year's dried oregano in the old school yard after evening service\, and everyone jumps over the flames three times for luck\, then there is music and dancing. It is the only Sfakiotes village that kept the custom\; organised by the Sfakiotes cultural centre since 1990\, low-key and very local.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lefkada/#pinakochori-lamparda-of-agios-ioannis-fire-jumping-pinakocho
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lefkada/#pinakochori-lamparda-of-agios-ioannis-fire-jumping-pinakocho
END:VEVENT
