BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lefkada-vlycho-panigiri-of-agia-kyriaki-vlycho-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270706
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270708
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Kyriaki\, Vlycho
LOCATION:Vlycho\, Lefkada\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The chapel of Agia Kyriaki sits on the rock across the bay from Vlycho\, and the village's panigiri around her feast (6–7 July) has grown into the biggest folk-music night of the Lefkada summer\, with name clarinet players from Epirus and Aitoloakarnania booked each year and dancing on the waterfront until dawn. Held on or just before 7 July\; expect crowds from the mainland\, get there by 10pm and park on the Nydri road.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lefkada/#vlycho-panigiri-of-agia-kyriaki-vlycho
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lefkada/#vlycho-panigiri-of-agia-kyriaki-vlycho
END:VEVENT
