LOCATION:Eglouvi\, Lefkada\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On the feast of the Transfiguration the Eglouvi cultural association cooks the village's famous lentils the old way in cauldrons on the Agios Donatos plateau above the village\, and serves them free with bread\, olives and wine from about 7pm\, followed by live music and dancing under the stars. Parking on the plateau is chaotic\; the association runs a shuttle bus from the old KTEL station in Lefkada town at 6:30pm with a stop at Agios Minas\, which is the sane way up.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lefkada/#eglouvi-lentil-festival-at-agios-donatos-eglouvi
