BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lefkada-nikiana-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-nikiana-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270806
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration\, Nikiana
LOCATION:Nikiana\, Lefkada\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Nikiana's church of the Saviour celebrates on 6 August with a big open-air panigiri on the seafront the same evening\, booking well-known folk singers and a full orchestra\; food and drink from the village associations\, dancing late. Nikiana is on the east-coast road 10 minutes north of Nydri\, so it is easy to combine with a stay anywhere on that coast.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lefkada/#nikiana-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-nikiana
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lefkada/#nikiana-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-nikiana
END:VEVENT
