BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lefkada-lazarata-feast-of-agios-spyridon-lazarata-and-karya-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270810
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270812
SUMMARY:Feast of Agios Spyridon\, Lazarata and Karya
LOCATION:Lazarata\, Lefkada\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The 11 August miracle of Agios Spyridon is a big day in the Sfakiotes villages: in Lazarata there is vespers with artoklasia on the 10th\, liturgy on the morning of the 11th and an evening procession of the icon through the village to the square\, while neighbouring Karya carries its own reliquary under the plane trees the same morning. Village tavernas and the squares fill up afterwards\; the lay panigiri on Karya's square has traditionally followed the same weekend.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lefkada/#lazarata-feast-of-agios-spyridon-lazarata-and-karya
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lefkada/#lazarata-feast-of-agios-spyridon-lazarata-and-karya
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lefkada-lazarata-feast-of-agios-spyridon-lazarata-and-karya-2028@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20280810
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20280812
SUMMARY:Feast of Agios Spyridon\, Lazarata and Karya
LOCATION:Lazarata\, Lefkada\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The 11 August miracle of Agios Spyridon is a big day in the Sfakiotes villages: in Lazarata there is vespers with artoklasia on the 10th\, liturgy on the morning of the 11th and an evening procession of the icon through the village to the square\, while neighbouring Karya carries its own reliquary under the plane trees the same morning. Village tavernas and the squares fill up afterwards\; the lay panigiri on Karya's square has traditionally followed the same weekend.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lefkada/#lazarata-feast-of-agios-spyridon-lazarata-and-karya
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lefkada/#lazarata-feast-of-agios-spyridon-lazarata-and-karya
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lefkada-kalamitsi-panigiri-of-the-dormition-kalamitsi-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Dormition\, Kalamitsi
LOCATION:Kalamitsi\, Lefkada\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Kalamitsi\, the hill village above Kathisma beach\, runs a two-night panigiri on 14 and 15 August in the old school yard\, organised by the Neromylos cultural society: live folk orchestra\, souvlaki and local wine\, dancing until late. It is the closest proper village panigiri to the west-coast beaches\; the road up from Kathisma is steep and parking is on the roadside.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lefkada/#kalamitsi-panigiri-of-the-dormition-kalamitsi
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lefkada/#kalamitsi-panigiri-of-the-dormition-kalamitsi
END:VEVENT
